<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0654_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup? I can’t hear you real good...\nThe connection trash...\rTry callin’ me again from a\ndifferent spot, please.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup... How you doin’?\nI’m doin’ well, thanks.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s SO many other Hustlers out\nthere way stronger than me...\fYou should go try ’em.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s see...\nI’m usually free Wednesdays\faround noon. I could spare a minute...\rWhy don’t you call me again then...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Amphy been doin’ better lately. I also\nbeen able to take some me-time.\rWhat you think? You wanna\nscrap me again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Got it...\nSee you at the Saffron Dojo, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\rBefore you scrap me again, ain’t you\ngot other plans to keep?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Got it. I’ll be waitin’ at\nthe Saffron Dojo.\fI’ll see you there.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Jasmine.\nHow I sound? Healthy?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ain’t forget your promise to\nmeet me for a scrap, did you?\rI’m still waitin’ at\nthe Saffron Dojo...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You been to the Lighthouse lately?\rI been so busy myself. I ain’t\nbeen able to get over there to see\fAmphy much...\rBut...whenever I see the Lighthouse\nlight at night, I always think,\f“I hope you good, Amphy.”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Um...\nThere’s somethin’ I been meanin’ to\fask you... What you think of my Block?\fWas the vibe a lil weird?\rBut...I mean, steel always look\npretty cold and unfriendly, but I was\ftryin’ to make it at least a lil cute.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0654_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Warden Baoba at the Safari Zone...\nHe came by my Block once to\fintroduce himself...\rHe talk a lil different, don’t\nhe? I heard it’s called anastrophe...</language>
	</row>
</body>
